# global-arre: Is `arre=1`, a shortened `arret`, an undeclared global target XPPAUT refuses (XPPAUT 8.2.2)?
# xpp: error
# pc: ODE0058
# ruling: only the full names `arret` and `out_put` are event actions. Any other undeclared target stays ODE0058 (language.md, Statement details).
x'=1
x(0)=0
aux v=x
global 1 x-0.55 {arre=1}
@ total=2,dt=0.1,meth=euler
